
  --- Sandstone Dashboard Quick Checks ---
checkservices      # Check all Sandstone Dashboard services
gettemps           # Follow /var/log/SandstoneDashboard/getTemps.log
checktemps         # Show 1-Wire temp senser IDs & temps: -l to loop
viewconfig         # View temp sensor config: <ID match>, -t for title only
checki2c           # View I2C sensor IDs. 0x44 (SHT30), 0x48 (Pressure)
ssdcommands        # Show more commands

